<main class="legal-stage">
<div class="legal-card">
<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
<p class="legal-updated">Last updated: January 2026</p>
<p>
        This policy explains what personal information Gedion Mutua ("I", "me") collects through
        this website, why it's collected, and how it's used. It applies to
        <strong>gedionmutua.com</strong> and the booking and contact tools on it.
      </p>
<h2>What I collect</h2>
<ul>
<li>Name and any contact details you enter when booking a session.</li>
<li>M-Pesa confirmation details (name and transaction code) you submit to verify a payment.</li>
<li>Messages you send via WhatsApp when you contact me directly.</li>
</ul>
<h2>How it's used</h2>
<p>
        Information you submit is used only to confirm bookings, verify payments, and communicate
        with you about the session you've booked. It is not sold, rented, or shared with third
        parties for marketing purposes.
      </p>
<h2>How it's stored</h2>
<p>
        Booking and payment details are sent directly to WhatsApp and are not stored in a separate
        database on this website. WhatsApp's own privacy practices apply to messages exchanged
        there.
      </p>
<h2>Your rights</h2>
<p>
        You can ask what information I hold about you, request it be corrected, or ask for it to be
        deleted, by contacting me on WhatsApp or via the contact page. Under Kenya's Data Protection
        Act, 2019, you're entitled to access and control your personal data.
      </p>
<h2>Cookies</h2>
<p>
        This site does not currently use tracking or advertising cookies. If that changes, this
        policy will be updated to reflect it.
      </p>
<h2>Contact</h2>
<p>
        Questions about this policy can be sent via the <a href="/contact">contact page</a> or
        on <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/gedion-mutua-841481100/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">LinkedIn</a>
